            "[4] Marsely L. Kehoe, “Dutch Batavia: Exposing the Hierarchy of the Dutch Colonial City,” Journal of Historians of Netherlandish Art 7:1 (Winter 2015); Adam Clulow. “‘Splendour and Magnificence’: Diplomacy and Sumptuary Codes in Early Modern Batavia,” in The Right to Dress: Sumptuary Laws in a Global Perspective, c. 1200-1800 , ed. Giorgio Riello and Ulinka Rublack( Cambridge University Press, 2019), 299–324.",
